, "tool_calls": ["mcp__statcan__statcan_cube_vectors", "mcp__statcan__statcan_cube_vectors", "mcp__statcan__statcan_series"], "is_error": false, "response": "Alberta's child poverty rate was **12.8%** in 2024, the latest year published. This is the share of persons under 18 in low income, measured with the Market Basket Measure (Canada's official poverty line, 2023 base).\n\nRecent years:\n\n| Year | Rate |\n|---|---|\n| 2020 | 4.6% |\n| 2021 | 8.1% |\n| 2022 | 12.0% |\n| 2023 | 11.9% |\n| 2024 | 12.8% |\n\nOther low-income lines, such as the Low Income Measure, give different rates. I did not pull those.\n\nSource: Statistics Canada, table 11-10-0135-01 (Low income statistics by age, gender and economic family type), vector v1792632015, annual, reference period 2024.\n\n```json\n{\"values\": [\n{\"name\": \"Alberta child poverty rate (persons under 18 in low income, MBM 2023 base)\", \"value\": 12.8, \"unit\": \"%\", \"period\": \"2024\"},\n{\"name\": \"Alberta child poverty rate (MBM 2023 base)\", \"value\": 11.9, \"unit\": \"%\", \"period\": \"2023\"},\n{\"name\": \"Alberta child poverty rate (MBM 2023 base)\", \"value\": 12.0, \"unit\": \"%\", \"period\": \"2022\"},\n{\"name\": \"Alberta child poverty rate (MBM 2023 base)\", \"value\": 8.1, \"unit\": \"%\", \"period\": \"2021\"},\n{\"name\": \"Alberta child poverty rate (MBM 2023 base)\", \"value\": 4.6, \"unit\": \"%\", \"period\": \"2020\"}\n],\n\"sources\": [{\"publisher\": \"Statistics Canada\", \"id\": \"Table 11-10-0135-01, vector v1792632015\"}],\n\"not_published\": false,\n\"abstain\": false,\n\"abstain_reason\": \"\"}\n```", "repeat": 0, "cost_usd": 0.46894620000000004, "input_tokens": 8, "output_tokens": 1138, "cache_read_tokens": 298422, "cache_creation_tokens": 106927}
