ed\":false,\n\"abstain\":false,\n\"abstain_reason\":\"\"}\n```", "repeat": 0, "cost_usd": 0.10417309999999999, "input_tokens": 8, "output_tokens": 1484, "cache_read_tokens": 391451, "cache_creation_tokens": 12543}
